flowchart TD
    Q[User Query] --> S[Safety + Normalize]
    S --> T{Complexity / Intent}
    T -->|FAQ or general concept| C[Retrieval Chatbot]
    T -->|Skill gap / personalized roadmap| A[ReAct Agent]
    T -->|Missing target/profile/time| CL[Clarification]
    T -->|Unsafe or unsupported claim| F[Safe Fallback]
    A --> TOOL[Tool Registry]
    TOOL --> OBS[Real Observation]
    OBS --> D{Enough evidence?}
    D -->|No, budget remains| A
    D -->|Yes| V[Validate Output]
    V -->|Pass| O[Final Answer + Evidence]
    V -->|Fail, revision remains| A
    V -->|Fail, limit reached| F
    C --> O
